OL,3,GNEWSAApplication refused for
OL,4,Aunder-threat padel court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn application for retrospective
OL,7,Fplanning permission for a padel court
OL,8,Fhas been refused.
OL,10,FIt was installed to replace a tennis
OL,11,Fcourt at The Retreat at Elcot Park - a
OL,12,Fhotel in Newbury, Berkshire - in
OL,13,FNovember 2025.
OL,15,FA West Berkshire Council planning
OL,16,Fmeeting heard concerns had been raised
OL,17,Fabout the noise impact on neighbours
OL,18,Fand lack of nearby bus stop, while
OL,19,Fsupporters said it had 1,500 registered
OL,20,Fplayers and was beneficial to people's
OL,21,Fhealth and social lives.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
