OL,3,GNEWSAApplication refused for
OL,4,Aunder-threat padel court
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdward Hopkins, who organised an event
OL,7,Fin support of the court, said the
OL,8,Fdecision taken on Wednesday was
OL,9,F"incredibly disappointing".
